@startuml
title QR Attendance System - Data Flow Structure

|Attendee|
start
:Enter personal details;

|System|
:Validate registration data;
:Store attendee information;

|Database|
:users table;

|Organizer|
:Enter event details;

|System|
:Validate event details;
:Store event information;

|Database|
:events table;

|Attendee|
:Join selected event;

|System|
:Record attendee-event relationship;

|Database|
:participants table;

|Attendee|
:Scan event QR code;
:Send QR data, device information,\nand location details;

|System|
:Validate QR code;
:Check participant registration;
:Check device and location data;

if (Attendance valid?) then (Yes)
  |Database|
  :attendance table;
else (No)
  |System|
  :Reject attendance attempt;
  :Display error message;
endif

|Organizer|
:Request attendance report;

|System|
:Retrieve users, events,\nparticipants and attendance data;
:Generate attendance report;

|Organizer|
:View attendance report;
stop

@enduml
